        <mxCell id="irAGRXVpb9IztkW0Ia6z-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;align=center;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; font-size: 42px;&quot;&gt;Overview&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 26px;&quot; align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Modularized abstraction for &lt;b&gt;generic computing device&lt;/b&gt;. It encapsulates multiple layers internally such as &lt;b&gt;board support package ( BSP )&lt;/b&gt;, &lt;b&gt;hardware abstraction layer ( HAL )&lt;/b&gt;, &lt;b&gt;drivers&lt;/b&gt;, &lt;b&gt;operating system&lt;/b&gt;, ... etc.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
